*** Keywords ***
uDTX_single_cell_operation_90_TPut
    [Documentation]  The purpose of this test case is verification of uDTX function on single cell, with 90% load,
    ...              on the gNB side.
    ...              - cell_id     -  ID of the cell that varying load operation will be performed on.
    ...              - call_duration  -  duration of data transfer test in seconds e.g. ‘300s’.
    ...              - throughput  - dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                              it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells.
    ...                              Example:
    ...                              {
    ...                                  '827736065':
    ...                                       {
    ...                                           'throughput':
    ...                                               {
    ...                                                   'downlink': '1450 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                   'uplink': '0 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                               },
    ...                                           'deviation': '10%'
    ...                                       },
    ...                              }
    ...               - protocol - data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...               - udp_buffer - monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...               - expected_increase  -  expected power increase (in percents %) on RU after disabling power saving feature,
    ...                                       defaults to 50.

    [Arguments]                                        ${cell_id}
    ...                                                ${call_duration}
    ...                                                ${throughput}
    ...                                                ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                                ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                                ${expected_increase}=50
    ${bts_type}=                                       hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                      connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${cell_dist_names}                                 admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                cell_type=nr
    ...                                                cell_id=${cell_id}
    ${rmod_id}                                         admin_info_model.get_rmod_ids_for_cell_id
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                cell_type=nr
    Disable Broadcasts                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    Configure Power Saving And Power Meter For 5G      enable_power_saving=${True}

    Sleep                                              5 min        Reason=Waiting for changes to be noticable
    ${ru_power_usage_with_concentration}               Get Power Usage During L3 Call
    ...                                                called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                direction=DL
    ...                                                call_duration=${call_duration}
    ...                                                throughput=${throughput}
    ...                                                protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot log step                                     Disabling traffic concentration...
    Configure Power Saving For 5G
    Sleep                                              5 min        Reason=Waiting for changes to be noticable
    ${ru_power_usage_without_concentration}            Get Power Usage During L3 Call
    ...                                                called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                direction=DL
    ...                                                call_duration=${call_duration}
    ...                                                throughput=${throughput}
    ...                                                protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot log operation                                Validating if power usage was increased for disabled traffic concentration...
    power_usage.validate_power_usage_change            start_power_usage=${ru_power_usage_with_concentration}
    ...                                                end_power_usage=${ru_power_usage_without_concentration}
    ...                                                expected_increase=${expected_increase}
    ...                                                rmod_id=${rmod_id}

    [Teardown]    Run Keywords                         Ensure Power Saving Is Disabled For 5G
    ...                                                AND
    ...                                                Clean Up Environment
